ent-WeaponGravityGun = gravity gun
    .desc = Manipulates gravity. Click to grab loose scrap or a whole hull and drag it with the cursor, use the mouse wheel to push it away or pull it closer, click again to launch it, use the gun in hand to let go. If the target is too heavy to move, you are the one who moves.

gravity-gun-nothing = There is nothing to grab there.
